verb/copula isn't needed... This goes on true with adjectives, placement
and presence of the/a, etc... I basically took the meanings of his words
and put them in Arabic ignoring the syntax and grammar he used... I ended
up with a pretty understandable Arabic piece and I added some bits of my
own after translation...

